---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Confirm your subscription"
  description="One more step to join the ReaderTweaks newsletter."
  path="/subscribe/"
  noindex
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap narrow prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Newsletter</p>
      <h1>Check your inbox</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        We've sent you a confirmation email. Click the link in it to finish
        signing up — you will not receive anything until you do. It sometimes
        lands in spam or promotions, so check there if it is not in your inbox
        within a few minutes.
      </p>

      <h2>Not seeing it?</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Check your spam and promotions folders — that is where it usually is.</li>
        <li>Give it a few minutes — it can be slow to arrive.</li>
        <li>
          Add <strong>hello@readertweaks.com</strong> to your contacts so future
          issues land in your inbox.
        </li>
        <li>
          Still nothing? Email
          <a href="mailto:hello@readertweaks.com">hello@readertweaks.com</a> and we
          will sort it out.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What to expect</h2>
      <p>
        One email when a new device guide or a worthwhile firmware note goes up —
        no more than twice a month. An issue may occasionally carry a clearly
        labelled sponsor; sponsors do not influence what we cover. Every issue has
        a one-click unsubscribe link.
      </p>

      <p><a href="/">Back to the homepage</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .narrow { max-width: 640px; }
  .prose h1 { font-size: var(--step-3); }
  .prose h2 { margin-top: 2rem; }
</style>
